{
 "name": "Voice-Note-to-Everything — Siva",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "Voice-Note-to-Everything — Siva\nTelegram voice note → transcription → Gemini splits it into tasks, calendar events and ideas → Todoist / Google Calendar / Notion. Nothing is created until Siva approves the split in Telegram.",
    "height": 120,
    "width": 480
   },
   "id": "c6c7680a-e9c1-4faf-9487-3a8fde3d7932",
   "name": "Sticky Note — Flow",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "MEMORY LAYER (no live DB): the Voice Notes Log sheet is the memory — one row per voice note (transcript, tasks, events, ideas). Gemini prompts include past rows so repeat requests are recognised. Postgres/vector store can replace the sheet later; do not invent a live DB connection.",
    "height": 120,
    "width": 480
   },
   "id": "f073ea26-d7c7-4d0b-bbf1-ea8a18118f38",
   "name": "Sticky Note — Memory Layer",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    720,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "CREDENTIALS NEEDED (pick/create on import — no credential is set in this file):\n- Telegram API — Telegram Trigger, Get Voice File, Send Approval Summary, Notify on Error\n- Speech-to-text service of your choice (Gemini transcription recommended, or any STT API) — Transcribe Voice (STT — placeholder). Point the node at your STT endpoint (currently https://YOUR_STT_ENDPOINT/transcribe) and add its auth as a credential on the node; no key or secret is stored in this file.\n- Todoist API token — Create Todoist Tasks\n- Google Calendar (OAuth2) — Create Calendar Events\n- Notion API key — Save Ideas to Notion\n- Google Sheets (OAuth2) — Log Created Items, Log Error to Sheet, Log Execution\n- Google Gemini (PaLM) API — Gemini Chat Model",
    "height": 120,
    "width": 480
   },
   "id": "2ee9af9c-0cb7-4244-b182-d994c7216f03",
   "name": "Sticky Note — Credentials",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    1440,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "updates": [
     "message"
    ],
    "additionalFields": {}
   },
   "id": "51318a3e-42d6-440d-9cae-b532c9f19385",
   "name": "Telegram Trigger",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    0,
    300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "get",
    "resource": "file",
    "fileId": "={{ $json.message.voice.file_id }}"
   },
   "id": "5d9a32af-5503-4b84-b9e0-70ec04b8ba02",
   "name": "Get Voice File",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    240,
    300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "https://YOUR_STT_ENDPOINT/transcribe",
    "options": {
     "response": {
      "response": {
       "responseFormat": "json"
      }
     },
     "timeout": 10000
    },
    "sendBody": true,
    "specifyBody": "json",
    "jsonBody": "{\"file\": \"={{ $binary.data }}\"}"
   },
   "id": "72e86adb-1cf6-4294-a961-9c52645a28ab",
   "name": "Transcribe Voice (STT — placeholder)",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    480,
    300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "model": "gemini-2.0-flash",
    "options": {
     "temperature": 0.3
    }
   },
   "id": "13a8de73-4c5e-4fed-8bdc-d08673e68599",
   "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
   "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    720,
    100
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "promptType": "define",
    "text": "=Split this transcript into (1) tasks, (2) calendar events with dates/times, (3) ideas. Transcript: {{ $json.text }}. Return JSON only: {tasks:[{title, due}], events:[{title, start, end}], ideas:[{title, note}]}. Use only what the speaker said; never invent dates.",
    "options": {
     "systemMessage": "You split voice-note transcripts into tasks, calendar events and ideas. Output JSON only. Never invent a date, person or commitment that is not in the transcript."
    }
   },
   "id": "85bab4c5-1271-4427-8324-614b480ea959",
   "name": "Split into Tasks / Events / Ideas (Gemini Agent)",
   "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
   "typeVersion": 1.8,
   "position": [
    720,
    300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "sendMessage",
    "chatId": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
    "text": "=Your voice note split:\n{{ $json.output }}\nReply APPROVE to create the tasks, events and notes, or REJECT to skip.",
    "additionalFields": {}
   },
   "id": "99062a9b-11d9-49ba-b83f-66d8b0952790",
   "name": "Send Approval Summary",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    960,
    300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "amount": 4,
    "unit": "hours"
   },
   "id": "725301dd-8d21-439f-a873-a08d5f414970",
   "name": "Wait for Approval",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
   "typeVersion": 1.1,
   "position": [
    1200,
    300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "conditions": {
     "options": {
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "leftValue": "",
      "typeValidation": "loose"
     },
     "conditions": [
      {
       "id": "cond-1",
       "leftValue": "={{ $json.approved }}",
       "rightValue": "",
       "operator": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "operation": "true"
       }
      }
     ],
     "combinator": "and"
    },
    "looseTypeValidation": true
   },
   "id": "307bfb8a-834b-49fb-963e-6794292f2034",
   "name": "Approved?",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
   "typeVersion": 2.2,
   "position": [
    1440,
    300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "https://api.todoist.com/rest/v2/tasks",
    "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
    "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
    "options": {
     "response": {
      "response": {
       "responseFormat": "json"
      }
     },
     "timeout": 10000
    },
    "sendBody": true,
    "specifyBody": "json",
    "jsonBody": "{\"content\": \"={{ $json.tasks[0].title }}\"}"
   },
   "id": "6865032a-3290-4747-a51c-490c40a1095a",
   "name": "Create Todoist Tasks",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    1680,
    180
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "create",
    "calendar": "primary",
    "summary": "={{ $json.events[0].title }}",
    "start": {
     "dateTime": "={{ $json.events[0].start }}"
    },
    "end": {
     "dateTime": "={{ $json.events[0].end }}"
    }
   },
   "id": "196b4358-d5b7-44e0-b612-6fdc92b99f7a",
   "name": "Create Calendar Events",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    1920,
    180
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "https://api.notion.com/v1/pages",
    "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
    "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
    "options": {
     "response": {
      "response": {
       "responseFormat": "json"
      }
     },
     "timeout": 10000
    },
    "sendBody": true,
    "specifyBody": "json",
    "jsonBody": "{\"parent\": {\"database_id\": \"YOUR_NOTION_DATABASE_ID\"}, \"properties\": {\"title\": {\"title\": [{\"text\": {\"content\": \"={{ $json.ideas[0].title }}\"}}]}}}"
   },
   "id": "d11ddd22-6777-48de-8431-0883bff7717a",
   "name": "Save Ideas to Notion",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    2160,
    180
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "append",
    "documentId": "YOUR_VOICE_NOTES_SHEET_ID",
    "sheetName": "Log",
    "columns": {
     "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
     "value": {
      "timestamp": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
      "transcript": "={{ $json.text }}",
      "tasks": "={{ $json.output }}",
      "status": "created after approval"
     }
    }
   },
   "id": "1ac86c1f-a81e-4429-ae97-94dc87097123",
   "name": "Log Created Items",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4,
   "position": [
    2400,
    180
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "assignments": {
     "assignments": [
      {
       "id": "8098f468",
       "name": "status",
       "value": "skipped — not approved",
       "type": "string"
      }
     ]
    },
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "505dfbb4-2527-4c43-a72d-d2f8f5390f2a",
   "name": "Log Skipped",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
   "typeVersion": 3.4,
   "position": [
    1680,
    420
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "mode": "append",
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "da504fdc-8a29-406e-b8cb-8cba8629300c",
   "name": "Merge Results",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
   "typeVersion": 3,
   "position": [
    2640,
    180
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "append",
    "documentId": "YOUR_EXECUTION_LOG_SHEET_ID",
    "sheetName": "Log",
    "columns": {
     "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
     "value": {
      "timestamp": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
      "workflow": "Voice-Note-to-Everything",
      "status": "={{ $json.status || 'done' }}",
      "detail": "={{ $json.output || $json.reason || '' }}"
     }
    }
   },
   "id": "829f0858-3946-4f98-9262-f7d63febef8f",
   "name": "Log Execution",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4,
   "position": [
    2880,
    180
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {},
   "id": "5bef04a8-785d-4385-a581-53eb516a8825",
   "name": "Error Trigger",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    0,
    700
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "append",
    "documentId": "YOUR_ERROR_LOG_SHEET_ID",
    "sheetName": "Errors",
    "columns": {
     "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
     "value": {
      "timestamp": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
      "workflow": "={{ $json.workflow?.name }}",
      "node": "={{ $json.execution?.lastNodeExecuted }}",
      "error": "={{ $json.execution?.error }}",
      "execution_id": "={{ $json.execution?.id }}"
     }
    }
   },
   "id": "da52ac25-ff96-4262-b0b5-81620881e00b",
   "name": "Log Error to Sheet",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4,
   "position": [
    240,
    700
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "sendMessage",
    "chatId": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
    "text": "=Voice-Note-to-Everything FAILED: {{ $json.error }}",
    "additionalFields": {}
   },
   "id": "3f38695b-d5c1-4265-bf79-4820703c0395",
   "name": "Notify on Error (Telegram)",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    480,
    700
   ]
  }
 ],
